          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            The notion of
            %strong locally graded category
            is a joint generalisation of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+categories"} enriched categories
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/actegories"} actegories
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/powered+and+copowered+categories"} powered categories
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/morphisms"} morphisms
            of a category by a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+category"} monoidal category
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi V
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V
            in such a way that
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/identity+morphisms"} identity morphisms
            have grade labeled by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/unit+object"} unit object
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi I
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} I
            and the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/composition"} composite
            of morphisms is graded by the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor+product"} tensor product
            of the separate grades.
          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            Let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi V
                  %mo ,
                  %mo ⊗
                  %mo ,
                  %mi I
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (V, \otimes, I)
            be a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+category"} monoidal category
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi V
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V
            %strong
              locally
              = succeed "-graded" do
